<title>FINLAND: FIVE LOCAL FINNISH PAPERS PLAN JOINT SUNDAY ISSUE.</title>
<headline>FIVE LOCAL FINNISH PAPERS PLAN JOINT SUNDAY ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five regional newspapers Ilkka , Karjalainen, Keskisuomalainen, Pohjalainen and Savon Sanomat plan a joint Sunday issue, Finnish news agency STT reported on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the papers would begin publishing joint Sunday issues at the start of 1997. The plan had not yet been approved by the media groups' boards.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
